Subject: [PATCH] Continue after host cgroup placement failure

Keep initial controller placement best-effort for the experimental TCG
profile. Controller construction is unchanged. This permits startup when
Asterinas rejects migration of the running shim via cgroup.procs, and does
not guarantee host cgroup resource limits or accounting.

--- a/virtcontainers/api.go
+++ b/virtcontainers/api.go
@@ -85,7 +85,7 @@
 
 	// Set the sandbox host cgroups.
 	if err := s.setupResourceController(); err != nil {
-		return nil, err
+		s.Logger().WithError(err).Warn("Continuing without host cgroup placement")
 	}
 
 	// Start the VM
